{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/case_recollection_.png?t=1748770863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a1\u25a1 wakes up in a strange office. \u25a1\u25a1\u25a1 has lost his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A woman claiming to be a consulting private detective is by his side and seems to know \u25a1\u25a1\u25a1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out why he lost his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game description.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element : Riddle solving, mystery, detective, (yuri)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duration: 30-40 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty level: casual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main heroine.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/stand_by__ver0.2_subject02.gif?t=1748770863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Japanese name: Yaka Sharoku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English name: Sharok Holmes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;Profile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">158 cm, 48 kg, type AB, born 1/6, 27 years old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gender: female.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Occupation, advisory private detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only consulting private detective in Japan who is a member of the police force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Born in London, graduated first in her law degree from the University of Cambridge, specialising in law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Specialist in psychology, anthropology and forensic science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has used his abilities to solve a number of difficult cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On official papers, he appears to be descended from a lineage descended from Holmes' brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first glance, he may appear to be a light-tempered, soft-hearted womaniser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In fact, like his ancestors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He takes pride in being a good guardian of law and order and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He fulfils the duties of a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573410?t=1748770863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/e99e6ff8c9b14a8b05732ac8a10197690f9c9211/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748770863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/f017828be905cf293c03ce40c1321a350962ed47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748770863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/f017828be905cf293c03ce40c1321a350962ed47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748770863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/case_recollection_.png?t=1748770863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a1\u25a1 wakes up in a strange office. \u25a1\u25a1\u25a1 has lost his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A woman claiming to be a consulting private detective is by his side and seems to know \u25a1\u25a1\u25a1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out why he lost his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game description.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element : Riddle solving, mystery, detective, (yuri)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duration: 30-40 minutes</p><p